# mod-custom-spells: the Paladin lines of the third concept list
# (operator 2026-10-31; share-public
# custom-spells/records/2026-10-31-third-concept-list.md), wave 2 = procs.
# Every check states the list's line, so a FAIL marks a defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018: take 0 damage, never die, the combat log still reads the full
# amount) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150); d1 = the west-most one. The
# paladin stands in the ring's middle for the bursts (every dummy within 10 yd
# of it and of d1). A burst check reads `maxtargets` (the units one cast
# selected, misses included): the bot has no spell hit.
# Spells: Holy Light 48782 (rank 13, chain 635), Flash of Light 48785 (rank 9,
# chain 19750), Holy Shock 48825 (cast; its heal 48821 / damage 48823, chains
# 25914 / 25912), Hammer of Justice 10308 (rank 4, stun, family flag 0x800).
# The training dummies may be immune to the real Hammer of Justice stun, so the
# stun is put on by the director: `.aura 10308` (the aura of the real spell,
# applied at the unit's next update - wait for it).
# Triggered casts (`triggered`) run the SpellScripts of the cast spell; the
# damage-done proc of 900242 (Holy Shock's damage is a triggered cast of the
# dummy cast, PROC_ATTR_TRIGGERED_CAN_PROC) is checked with the same casts.
name    Custom spells - Paladin third list
timeout 300s

bot pa paladin slot=4

place 13 -270 150 -423.2 0
require pa alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near pa
require d1 exists
do gm target pa
as gm .unlearn 900213
as gm .unlearn 900214
as gm .unlearn 900242
do pa learn 48782
do pa learn 48785
do pa learn 48825
do pa learn 10308
do pa goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Holy
log Control - without the passives no burst comes: a Holy Light, a Flash of Light and a Holy Shock heal on the paladin
do pa reset
as gm .damage 3000
spelllog start
do pa cast 48782 on pa triggered
wait 800ms
do pa cast 48785 on pa triggered
wait 800ms
do pa cast 48825 on pa triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pa spell 48782 casts >= 1
expect pa spell 48785 casts >= 1
expect pa spell 48821 hits >= 1
expect pa spell 900215 casts == 0

log Holy - 900213 "Casting a holy heal spell enlightens the area around the target, dealing damage scaling with your paragon level": a Holy Light, a Flash of Light and a Holy Shock heal each strike every dummy within 10 yd of the healed paladin (900215, Holy, 666 + 5 x Paragon level)
do pa learn 900213
do pa reset
as gm .damage 3000
spelllog start
do pa cast 48782 on pa triggered
wait 800ms
do pa cast 48785 on pa triggered
wait 800ms
do pa cast 48825 on pa triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pa spell 900215 casts >= 3
expect pa spell 900215 maxtargets >= 6

log Holy - 900213 a heal on a unit that stands elsewhere strikes round THAT unit: the director 78 yd north of the ring has no enemy within 10 yd, so the burst is cast (the heal landed) and reaches nobody
do gm goto -270 228 -422.72
wait 500ms
do pa learn 900213
do pa reset
spelllog start
do pa cast 48782 on gm triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pa spell 900215 casts >= 1
expect pa spell 900215 maxtargets <= 1
do gm goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .unlearn 900213

log Control - Holy Shock on a target that is not under Hammer of Justice: no eruption (three tries: a miss is legal)
do pa reset
spelllog start
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 500ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 500ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pa spell 48823 hits >= 1
expect pa spell 900216 casts == 0

log Holy - 900214 "Casting Holy Shock on a target affected by Hammer of Justice, Light erupts and deals damage depending on paragon level in aoe": d1 under Hammer of Justice (10308), a damaging Holy Shock erupts round it (900216, anchor left out)
do pa learn 900214
do gm target d1
as gm .aura 10308
waitfor d1 aura 10308 timeout 3s
do gm target pa
do pa reset
spelllog start
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 500ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 500ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pa spell 48823 hits >= 1
expect pa spell 900216 casts >= 1
expect pa spell 900216 maxtargets >= 6
do gm target d1
as gm .unaura 10308
do gm target pa
as gm .unlearn 900214

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Protection
log Control - a Holy Shock on a dummy that is NOT stunned: no wave
do pa learn 900242
do pa reset
spelllog start
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 500ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 500ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pa spell 48823 hits >= 1
expect pa spell 900243 casts == 0

log Protection - 900242 "Hitting a stunned target launches a wave of light dealing damage around it scaling with paragon lvl (1sec cd per target)": d1 stunned, four Holy Shocks 200 ms apart (inside one second): at least one hits, the wave (900243, Holy, 10 yd) strikes the dummies round d1 ONCE
do gm target d1
as gm .aura 10308
waitfor d1 aura 10308 timeout 3s
do gm target pa
do pa reset
spelllog start
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 200ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 200ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 200ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pa spell 48823 hits >= 1
expect pa spell 900243 casts == 1
expect pa spell 900243 maxtargets >= 6

log Protection - 900242 the cooldown is per target, 1 s: two groups of four Holy Shocks (250 ms apart, 1.5 s between the groups) strike twice, once for each group (d1's stun refreshed first: it lasts 6 s)
do gm target d1
as gm .aura 10308
waitfor d1 aura 10308 timeout 3s
do gm target pa
do pa reset
spelllog start
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 250ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 250ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 250ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 250ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 250ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 250ms
do pa cast 48825 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pa spell 900243 casts == 2

cleanup
do pa stop
do gm target d1
as gm .unaura 10308
do gm target pa
as gm .unlearn 900213
as gm .unlearn 900214
as gm .unlearn 900242
